'''Palmarés''' ({{IPA-bl|palmaʀɛs}}; {{Literal translation|place of palms}}), is the historical capital and most populous city of [[Abellesia]], a region of the [[Bayara|Bayaran]] [[Communities of Balisca|community]] within the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. 

